Drivers’ gaze patterns when resuming control with a head-up-display: Effects of automation level and time budget
Chengliang Xu a,*, Tyron L. Louw b, Natasha Merat b, Penghui Li c,d, Mengxia Hu a, Yibing Li a,*
a State Key Laboratory of Automotive Safety and Energy, School of Vehicle and Mobility, Tsinghua University, China b Institute for Transport Studies, University of Leeds, UK c Key Laboratory of Transport Industry of Big Data Application Technologies for Comprehensive Transport, School of Traffic and Transportation, Beijing Jiaotong University, Beijing, China d State Key Laboratory of Vehicle NVH and Safety Technology, China Automotive Engineering Research Institute Co., Ltd., Chongqing, China

